{"abstract":"Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) is a widely used method for controlling access to data in data management systems, offering a scalable approach to enforcing security policies. Despite its broad adoption, RBAC implementations vary significantly across different systems, leading to inconsistencies in performance. Currently, there is no standardized benchmark for evaluating RBAC performance. In this study, we propose a benchmark that focuses on two core components: the creation of role hierarchies with varying structures and the access to securable objects and role metadata through SQL queries. We evaluate three systems—PostgreSQL, MariaDB, and Snowflake—across on-premise and cloud deployments. Our findings reveal notable differences in RBAC performance, driven by I/O demand, caching behavior, and system architecture. These results highlight the diversity of RBAC implementations and the need for a systematic approach to evaluate RBAC at scale.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Hansen, Mads Cornelius","Tözün, Pinar","Hentschel, Martin"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-860895"],"event":{"end":"2025-09-01","place":"London, gb","start":"2025-09-01","title":"Technology Conference on Performance Evaluation &amp; Benchmarking","year":"2025"},"filters":{"added":"2026-07","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"benchmarking role based access control in data management systems","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://itu-dasyalab.github.io/RAD/publication/papers/rbac_tpctc2025.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-860895","ids":["itu-22234ff8-5786-4f75-b360-23087257cad4"],"keyword":["Cloud and On-Premises Deployment","RBAC Benchmarking","Role Hierarchies","Role-Based Access Control","SQL-Based Access Control"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2E3F19B7D47A74C3F9352A0B2146C1FB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://itu-dasyalab.github.io/RAD/publication/papers/rbac_tpctc2025.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Center for Climate IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Data, Systems, and Robotics","IT University of Copenhagen, Data, Systems, and Robotics, Data-intensive Systems and Applications","IT University of Copenhagen, Data, Systems, and Robotics, Resource-Aware Data Systems","IT University of Copenhagen, Data-intensive Systems and Applications Lab"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Mads Cornelius","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Mads Cornelius","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Pınar","key":"tözünpau","last":"Tözün","locid":"63342b24-28ec-40c5-a7d9-ec49867dc75d","name":"Tözün, Pinar","name_org":"Tözün, Pınar","orcid":"0000-0001-6838-4854","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin","key":"hentschelpau","last":"Hentschel","locid":"54e42219-4e3f-42cd-a19d-66c82ee60654","name":"Hentschel, Martin","orcid":"0009-0004-8528-4168","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"1-17","status":"p","title":"TPC Technology Conference on Performance Evaluation &amp; Benchmarking"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST"